  "id": "prenatal-diagnosis",
  "term": "prenatal diagnosis",
  "definition": "Prenatal diagnosis is the process of determining a fetus’s genetic status during pregnancy. In this source, it refers specifically to non-invasive testing that analyzes cell-free DNA in maternal blood to infer whether the fetus has inherited a single-gene disorder, as an alternative to conventional prenatal diagnosis.",
